  "notes": [
    "**Crecer** is an -ER verb with irregular \"yo\" form in present",
    "Present: irregular \"yo\" form (crezco) with spelling change c→zc before o",
    "Preterite: regular -ER endings",
    "Imperfect: regular -ER pattern",
    "Used for physical growth (people, plants, things) and figurative growth (economy, population)",
    "Common usage: *Los niños crecen rápido* (Children grow fast), *Crecí en Argentina* (I grew up in Argentina)",
    "Same conjugation pattern as **parecer** and **conocer**"
